# Vendor CAD is fetched, never committed: Huber and Kohzu publish no terms
# at all (default copyright, not permission) and SmarAct forbids
# redistribution outright. See tools/cad/fetch_huber.py.
#
# Anchored to the repository root so it cannot swallow tools/cad/, which is
# the fetching code and must stay tracked.
